      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIFE YOUNG EVER (2) eye catching run on debut, and has only battled in two runs since. Nose roll goes on for this and he looks to find a winnable race. PARIAH TIME (1) five-start Maiden who can't draw a decent gate. Covered ground early before he knocked up late to finish sixth over 1150m at Illawarra Grange. Drops a grade for this and will appreciate Ellison's 4kg claim. Go close. OCEANSIDE (9) back without a trial and worth noting his lone placing came over the 1400m here last February. Senior rider goes on from the low gate and has to be respected. POWER HUNGRY (8) races best with his runs spaced and will find this more to his liking after running last over 1150m at Randwick Kensington. Placed here two-back and gets in light with the claim.",
